    "title": "Rory McIlroy's wife Erica Stoll: Are they still together?",
    "text": "April 11, 2026, 8:22 a.m. ETRory McIlroy and wife Erica Stoll have been in the public eye for nearly a decade, after the pair got married in 2017 and had daughter Poppy in 2020.So if you're here, you might be wondering: Is the couple still together? How did they meet? And what's next for them as McIlroy continues to be one of the best golfers in the world and among the all-time greats?The answer is: Yes, they're still together. There had been reports of them filing for divorce years ago, but that was called off in 2024, with McIlroy saying this: \"Over the past weeks, Erica and I have realized that our best future was as a family together. Thankfully, we have resolved our differences and look forward to a new beginning.”How did Rory McIlroy and his wife Erica meet?Per People:Stoll met McIlroy in 2012 at the Ryder Cup, where she had been working as a PGA transport official. After McIlroy overslept due to a time zone mixup and nearly missed his tee time, Stoll got him a police escort to the course in Medinah, Ill.But they didn't start dating until 2014 and McIlroy went public with the relationship in 2015.Who is Rory McIlroy's daughter Poppy?She's five years old and McIlroy has spoken about being a dad recently:As she proved in 2025, she's one heck of a putter, too:Adorable!",
